# AetherVault

> Intelligent file organization for a cleaner digital workspace.

AetherVault is a lightweight, extensible command-line utility designed to automatically organize files based on configurable classification rules.

Built for developers, power users, and anyone who wants to keep directories structured without manually sorting files.

---

## Features

* ⚡ Fast and lightweight
* 📁 Automatic file classification
* 🛡 Safe file handling with collision prevention
* 🔍 Dry-run mode for previewing operations
* ⚙️ Easily extensible file categories
* 🧩 Clean, modular architecture
* 🚫 Skips directories and hidden system files
* 📊 Displays an operation summary

