# Usage

Preview the operation before making changes:

```bash id="aether-preview"
aethervault ~/Downloads --dry-run
```

Organize the directory:

```bash id="aether-run"
aethervault ~/Downloads
```

Example output:

```text
[MOVED] report.pdf → documents/
[MOVED] photo.png → images/
[MOVED] project.zip → archives/
[MOVED] main.py → code/

Operation completed
-------------------
Processed: 4
Skipped:   0
Mode:      LIVE
```

